# Money Manager Project Governance

At the start of every new repository chat or session, the first action before
answering a project task or performing work is to read and follow
`docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md`.

Do not implement uncataloged scope. Follow the approved feature IDs, phase
sequence, document precedence, quality gates, and approval rules.
